@startuml bp5-hire-directly
!include style.iuml
title BP5 Hire a Provider Directly\n(US2-15 to US2-18, US2-9)

|Receiver|
start
:Find a service;
:Enter request details, budget,
and expected duration;
:Send hire request;

|MangoDB System|
if (Service open, Provider active,\nnot own service, no pending\nrequest, and valid?) then (no)
  :Reject request and
  show the reason;
  |Receiver|
  stop
else (yes)
  |MangoDB System|
  :Store hire request and
  record send time;
  :Hire Request
  <U+005B>Pending<U+005D>]
endif

|Provider|
:View hire requests
on own service;
:Evaluate the Receiver;

if (Decision?) then (accept)
  |MangoDB System|
  :Mark request Accepted;
  :Create project linked
  to the request;
  :Project
  <U+005B>Awaiting Quotation<U+005D>]
else (reject)
  |MangoDB System|
  :Mark request Rejected;
endif

|Receiver|
:See the result in My Proposals;
stop

note right
  Accepting keeps the service open.
  Other pending requests on it
  stay unchanged (US2-17).
end note
@enduml
